  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When lightning accumulates to a degree, it becomes liquid. The destructive force converts into a water of vitality that can draw out potential.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquid-lightning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightning path Gu Immortals often build lightning pools and store lightning water inside. They use those pools to nurture large numbers of lightning path mortal Gu. A lightning pool’s significance to lightning path Gu Immortals is like Five Light Mountain to light path Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-pools",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_lightning",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "loc_five_light_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the turbulent flow sea area, Fang Yuan meets a huge deep blue current whose every drop flickers with electricity, and he recognizes it as a lightning water current. Only the ripples at the top create destructive lightning; the water below is calm enough that sinking low keeps immortal essence expenditure low as he travels with the current.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turbulent-flow-current",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Hui Zi waters aurora-light seedlings with lightning water and magnetic sound so flowing light fruits grow on them after the light balls sprout in cloud soil.",
